{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":196592,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of Dubai\",\"tagline\":\"If you think money can’t buy you happiness, you clearly haven’t been to Dubai.\",\"overview\":\"As the 11th city in the franchise, the series highlights a group of women navigating their relationships, careers, and supremely lavish and ultra-wealthy lifestyles in the United Arab Emirates. With the desert paradise of Dubai as the backdrop, this billionaire's playground is known for its over-the-top opulence, jaw-dropping modern architecture and wild nightlife scene. Whether they're coasting on a private plane, running their own empires or hosting on a private island, these glamourous, successful women are ready to serve up scorching hot drama and unexpected twists.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nC8PyRTFwrs6xKDrGSJWoqcYBUR.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8kGaLkIdPWly8GJTZtzZBNsSwQ7.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":12,\"year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Canceled\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":2,\"totalEpisodes\":29,\"createdBy\":[\"Scott Dunlop\"],\"networks\":[\"Bravo\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2024-09-17\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":3489362,\"name\":\"Lesa Milan Hall\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/moVWWMB12d0YLEX8jQvujr43tMR.jpg\"},{\"id\":3489364,\"name\":\"Caroline Brooks\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q4BjVuHwQurEzRN4afCk0aUVKgf.jpg\"},{\"id\":3489366,\"name\":\"Sara Al Madani\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gIOSQk29Mt4Y39LFQ6pJHpHM3DW.jpg\"},{\"id\":3489367,\"name\":\"Chanel Ayan\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e6t5CXPyxxICte2hCdgQQIJKSR9.jpg\"},{\"id\":2041197,\"name\":\"Caroline Stanbury\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"h