ubai with their own special flair.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sADuN14IqR7XECd2J559eBarfX.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2022-06-08\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Lemons Into Lemonade\",\"overview\":\"It’s Fashion Week in Dubai and the designers aren’t the only ones putting on a show; Ayan and Brooks deal with the fallout of their argument at Nina’s dinner; Caroline worries about Serigio’s baby fever.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/62Zv9xTtPVAQUqSr2CUv1Fspd42.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2022-06-15\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Desert Détente\",\"overview\":\"Sergio and Caroline Stanbury come to an impasse regarding having children together; Caroline Brooks puts plans for her spa in motion; all the ladies meet up for the first time since the disastrous party; Sergio shares some laughs with Ayan and Lesa\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Z3phlcimspYTeNPnGzsgRas6Mi.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2022-06-22\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Piping Tea With a Hint of Peach\",\"overview\":\"Caroline Stanbury and Ayan begin to health their rift; Caroline Brooks welcomes longtime friend Phaedra Parks to the city of gold; Lesa and Caroline Stanbury square off over a ski suit; Nine tries to broker peace between Sergio and the bride-to-be.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oaEbRwmsh7qqzf5QRvTdGM2FVjd.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2022-07-06\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Dinner on the Rocks\",\"overview\":\"Caroline Stanbury clears up some issues with Lesa at an afternoon of high tea; Caroline Brooke throws a pool party; Ayan picks a bone with Nina; Sara’s unsolicited advice leads Caroline Brooke to question her relationship with her.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/arLluxe2DaRkzj5ou3oWZOzZ68R.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2022-07-13\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Meet the Carrallos\",\"overview\":\"Nina worries as her father’s condition worsens back home; Alan’s latest ensemble causes a stir.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kiZV8XGaAVJJywJVEd845jeVrEz.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2022-07-20\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Drama in the Sandbox\",\"overview\":\"Sara and Caroline Brooks turn the desert party upside down when tempers flare over unwanted advice. Carolina Stanbury and Sergio tie the knot at their magical wedding; a visit from Brooks' mother unearths some skeletons that she's forced to face.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rJjnyPVpfiyqJm3bMxCeXpZzx4R.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2022-07-27\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Dancehall It Out\",\"overview\":\"While newlyweds Sergio and Caroline Stanbury are in post-wedding bliss, Caroline Brooks is feeling dismissed and judged by Sara; Ayan and Nina try to bring Sara and Brooks to an understanding but leave things worse than before.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ntJuo23vRDd4T6DlkuKVhF18Upw.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2022-08-03\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Girls Trippin’\",\"overview\":\"A newly married Caroline leaves husband Sergio behind to whisk the women away on away on a girls trip to Nurai Island; secrets are revealed during salacious games of Never Have I Ever and Two Truths and a Lie\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/phkAmc7blx90ZTdRGvbKQ5BRgoG.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2022-08-10\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Salty Waters\",\"overview\":\"The weekend at Nurai Island comes to an end; Ayan and Caroline Standbury’s relationship is tested; Lesa confronts Nina about her friendship with Stanbury; Ayan reveals a painful truth about her past.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dlBcKnAJEljeq9O6cbK9LTEUAqS.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2022-08-17\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Du-bye Girl\",\"overview\":\"After Lesa and Ayan say goodbye to a loved one, Sara arranges a once-in-a-lifetime trip to Ras Al Khaimah for the ladies; while the group experiences fun and culture in the desert, drama is brewing just beneath the surface.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hFZWlTMeaWQsEh5n1G9pOYzvL4v.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2022-08-24\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Reunion (1)\",\"overview\":\"The ladies of Dubai bring the desert heat to New York City to face one another after a tumultuous season; Caroline Stanbury accuses Lesa of stealing her fashion designs and unveils her \\\"Book of Lies.\\\"\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pzvKPiel7gjTEtkB0zwmUbwhIBL.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2022-08-31\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Reunion (2)\",\"overview\":\"Caroline Stanbury and Lesa dig their heels in the sand and hash out their issues; Ayan reveals more of herself and opens up about her childhood trauma; the ladies exchange gifts to show each other what they think about one another.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nP9uEftlZAfIcW8FrJCrSP4rl6m.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-07\",\"runtime\":44}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2022-06-01\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}